[ beta ]

Ordet beta is ready for text, Markdown, and .ord writing workflows.
Printing, mail merge, and macros are not implemented yet. The interface is
English for this beta; translations are in progress.

Keep backups during beta testing. Autosave, recovery, Trash, and revision
restore are designed to protect work, but bug reports are welcome.

